<title>POLAND: Prochnik loss at PLN 4.2 mln in Q2.</title>
<headline>Prochnik loss at PLN 4.2 mln in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prochnik preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			 3.23   vs    1.14</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   4.19   vs    1.69</p>
<p>    net loss				 4.19   vs    1.69</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				6.33   vs    8.62</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 5.78   vs    7.10</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.09   vs    0.26</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.06   vs    0.81</p>
<p>    investment			     0.10   vs    1.27</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating loss			 3.17   vs    1.22</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   4.63   vs    1.97</p>
<p>    net loss				 4.63   vs    1.97</p>
<p>    net sales			     20.10   vs   19.31</p>
<p>    costs of sales			15.87   vs   15.58</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.19   vs    0.33</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.65   vs    1.07</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    investment			     0.34   vs    1.32</p>
